        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86448, Round District Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe District Cabinet Knob is a stunning piece of modern cabinet hardware. The Round District Cabinet Knob displays the perfect blend of styles that manages to be all at once contemporary and soft. The District Knob is available in small and large sizes in a wide range of finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Urban Modern District Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86449-specifications.pdf?v=1704262414\"><b>Emtek District Cabinet Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86448: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86449: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
